sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Existing MT5
    participant C as Neural label collector
    participant D as signals.db
    participant E as Diagnostic evaluation
    participant H as Cockpit
    C->>B: guarded read of positions and deals
    B-->>C: entry / partial or closed evidence
    C->>D: labels and ticket mappings
    Note over C,D: Missing SL basis or incomplete history defers labels
    C->>D: count completed outcomes
    alt complete count meets threshold and changed
        C->>E: evaluate_collection_gate
        E->>D: verify executed-trade provenance
        alt verified count below threshold
            E-->>C: CONTINUE with blocker
        else diagnostic promotion
            E-->>C: KEEP_SHADOW, consumer not wired
        end
        C->>C: persist neural_eval JSON atomically
    end
    H->>D: read count evidence
    H->>H: expose /api/neural with diagnostic artifact
    Note over E,H: No model activation or live-entry authorization
